---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Ph from '../components/Ph.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="County Island Community is a volunteer group of residents from the 13 county islands in the Peoria MPA.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">About CIC</p>
      <h1>Who we are</h1>
      <p class="lead">County Island Community (CIC) is a loosely organized, representative group of residents from the 13 county islands in the Peoria MPA.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:16px">
    <div class="container narrow prose">
      <p>We live inside Peoria's planning area, but we are not part of the city. No city council speaks for us, and no local body is focused on our needs.</p>
      <p>CIC exists to fill that gap. Neighbors speak up together so every island is heard.</p>
      <p>CIC is <Ph v="[ENTITY STATUS]" />.</p>

      <h2>Our area</h2>
      <p>There are 13 county islands, each with its own geography. Together they hold about <Ph v="[HOUSEHOLD COUNT]" /> households. <a href="/islands/">See the islands</a>.</p>
      <p>Our homes are in unincorporated Maricopa County. We do not vote in Peoria city elections.</p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <div class="grid two">
        <div class="card"><h3>Volunteer-run</h3><p class="muted">We are run by volunteers who live here.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Listen first</h3><p class="muted">We listen first, then act.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Nonpartisan</h3><p class="muted">Everyone in the islands is welcome.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Plain language</h3><p class="muted">We share what we learn in plain language.</p></div>
      </div>

      <h2>Representation</h2>
      <p>CIC aims to include residents from every one of the 13 islands.</p>
      <p>Volunteer coordinators: <Ph v="[BOARD MEMBER NAMES AND ROLES]" /></p>

      <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/get-involved/">Join CIC</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contact/">Contact us</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
